{"kind": "mod", "id": 1144, "name": "FAIR PRESET WITH BIGGER STASH", "slug": "fair-preset-with-bigger-stash", "teaser": "A balanced preset for KMC SERVER VALUE MODIFIER with bigger stash and more", "owner_name": "vampucio", "downloads": 6313, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "Creative Commons BY-NC-ND 4.0", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:03:11.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-11-04T15:40:03.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-11-04T15:40:03.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.9.0", "latest_version": "1.7.4+1", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/legalcode", "description_html": "<p><strong>This mod <em>requires <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/379-kmc-server-value-modifier-svm/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">KMC SERVER VALUE MODIFIER (SVM)</a></em> uploaded by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/3968-the-katto/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">The_Katto</a>, developed by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/7194-ghostfenixx/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GHOSTFENIXX</a></strong></p>\n<p>This mod is a preset, mostly identical to the great <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1243-fair-and-balanced-preset-for-svm/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">FAIR AND BALANCED PRESET FOR SVM</a> but with some modification. I recommend to use with my other mod <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1659-the-crafter/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">The crafter</a></p>\n<p>There is a <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/606-spt-realism-mod/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT Realism Mod</a> compatible profile too (settings in yellow are disabled in to realism version)</p>\n<p>IF YOU USE REALISM WITH MY PROFILE, LOAD REALISM BEFORE SVM</p>\n<p>Installation: copy the file in “mods/ServerValueModifier/presets” folder. Run Greed.exe, load the preset and apply</p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Inventory and Items</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>-No more backpack, secure container or others in raid restrictions</p>\n<p>-You can equip pistols in primary slots</p>\n<p>-Every object is now examined except the keys</p>\n<p>-Examination time is “zero”</p>\n<p>-Less Malfunctions</p>\n<p>-Reduced the Heat generation of each weapon by 10%</p>\n<p>-Increased pistol/smg ammo stacks at 80</p>\n<p>-GP coin stack raised at 100</p>\n<p>-Roubles stack raiced at 1000000</p>\n<p>-Analgin painkillers has 6 uses</p>\n<p>-Augmentin antibiotic pills has 2 uses</p>\n<p>-CMS surgical kit restores from 40% to 60% of max hp</p>\n<p>-Surv12 field surgical kit restores from 60% to 80% of max hp</p>\n<p>-Every melee weapon does +50% dmg</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Hideout</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>-Faster craft in the hideout but you will also consume fuel and filters faster too</p>\n<p>-Superfast construction time for the hideout</p>\n<p>-Your bitcoin farm can store 10 coins now</p>\n<p>-Fast energy/hydration regen off raid (based on your hideout level)</p>\n<p>-Stash Level 1 is 50 vertical lines</p>\n<p>-Stash Level 2 is 65 vertical lines</p>\n<p>-Stash Level 3 is 80 vertical lines</p>\n<p>-Stash Level 4 is 100 vertical lines</p>\n<p>-Stash “scam edition” is 125 vertical lines</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Traders and Traders services</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>-Removed timer for new quests from traders</p>\n<p>-Bear and Usec can use both faction clothes now</p>\n<p>-Prapor return in 2 hours</p>\n<p>-Therapist return in only 1 hour</p>\n<p>-Prapor return chance of 85%</p>\n<p>-Therapist return a chance of 75%</p>\n<p>-More exp from repair (with kits)</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Loot</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>-Tuned the dynamic loot multipliers for an offline game</p>\n<p>-Removed weapon from Barter and Medical airdrop, reduced the quantity for Mixed and Equipment</p>\n<p>-The airdrop can drop a bit before in the raid</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Players and Skills</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>-Your skills go up faster now</p>\n<p>-Energy and Hydration drain increased</p>\n<p>-Increased the stamina by 10%</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Raid options</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>-Converted the coop extraction to paid ones, 20000 (you can low the cost with scav karma)</p>\n<p>-Car extraction now has a 20 sec delay</p>\n<p>-More exp if you survive but almost no exp if you die</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-7\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Repeatable Quests</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>-2 daily quests</p>\n<p>-3 weekly quests</p>\n<p>-Tuned some value for a fairer gameplay</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-8\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Case Space Manager</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>-Alpha is 3x3</p>\n<p>-Beta is 3x4</p>\n<p>-Epsilon is 3x5</p>\n<p>-Gamma is 4x4</p>\n<p>-“Scam” Gamma is 4x4</p>\n<p>-Kappa is 4x5</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-9\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Player Scav</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>-Increased karma if you kill a pmc</p>\n<p>-Increased karma for car/coop extract</p>\n<p>-Karma loss increased if you kill a scav</p></div></div></div>\n<p>I hope you enjoy this preset</p>\n